noise law `ξ`: playing `x ∈ 𝒳` gives the feedback `⟪x, θ⟫ + ε` with `ε ∼ ξ`. -/
noncomputable abbrev linearKernel (𝒳 : Set E) (θ : E) (ξ : Measure ℝ) : Kernel 𝒳 ℝ :=
